      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأسّل أَبَاهُ</span></b> , (M, K,) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأسّنهُ</span>, (M, TA,)
<i>He resembled his father,</i> (M, K, TA,) <i>and assumed his natural dispositions;</i> and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَيَّلَهُ</span>.
(TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسَالُ</span>, below.]

